'''Food Stall Cat Awakes!''' (開眼のネコ屋台襲来！, ''Kaigan no Neko Yatai Shūrai!'', '''Awakened Cat Stall Attacks!''') introduces the [[True Form]] of [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Food Stall Cat]] - Cafeteria Cat. It is unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 2 and [[An Ancient Curse]]. This event was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

